     I've told you in the past of Frank's extraordinary record in=20
building Melville Corp. during his 23 year tenure as CEO.  Now, at=20
72, he's setting an even faster pace at Berkshire.  Frank has a=20
low-key, relaxed style, but don't let that fool you.  When he=20
